flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User opens watchlist settings]
    B --> C[User enters entities]
    C --> D[Submit watchlist]
    D --> E[API validates authenticated user]
    E --> F[Save comma-separated watchlist to database]
    F --> G[Future media task reads watchlist]
    G --> H[Detected entities compared to watchlist]
    H --> I{Any matches?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Save alert_matches and set status alerted]
    I -- No --> K[Save no matches and set status completed]
    J --> L([End])
    K --> L
